.Dd July 17, 2026
.Dt RETICULUM-GO-CP 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm reticulum-go-cp , rgocp
.Nd copy files over Reticulum links
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm reticulum-go Cm cp
.Op Fl l
.Op Fl f
.Op Fl F Ar remote_path
.Op Fl config Ar dir
.Op Ar ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Transfers files over established Reticulum links.
Listen mode
.Pq Fl l
receives files.
Fetch mode
.Pq Fl f
requests a remote path.
Without those flags, files are sent to a destination.
.Pp
Run with
.Fl h
for the full flag list.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr reticulum-go 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Quad4.io
